        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a creative prompt generator for Instagram-worthy image combinations. Based on two image analyses and a client's request, create ONE enhanced promotional prompt (max 400 characters) that describes how to merge these images into an engaging social media visual while incorporating the client's specific vision.\n\nYour task:\n1. Analyze the product/object from image 1 and person/scene from image 2\n2. Review the client's original prompt request and preferences\n3. Create a natural interaction between the images that aligns with the client's vision\n4. Choose an appropriate location that fits both elements and the client's desired style\n5. Define emotions and mood for Instagram appeal while respecting client's intent\n6. Keep it under 400 characters\n7. Focus on lifestyle and authentic moments\n8. Enhance the client's idea by incorporating specific visual elements from both image analyses\n9. Maintain the client's core concept while making it more visually compelling\n10. Do not add hashtags, emojis, multiple options, or explanations.\n\nFormat: Output must be ONLY one single sentence or short paragraph describing the enhanced combined scene. No extra text.\n\nInput format:\nImage 1 Analysis: {{ $('Get Image 1 Info').item.json.analyze_image }}\nImage 2 Analysis: {{ $json.analyze_image }}\nClient's Original Prompt: {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.prompt }}\n\nOutput: One enhanced generation prompt that combines both images according to the client's enhanced request."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
